  (text "CALYX-LEVEL CARRIER  rev A   (Corallite Labs)\nPlugs onto an Olimex ESP32-POE-ISO (WROOM) via EXT1/EXT2. One board for every role (sensor / pump / single):\n6 level jacks (3.5 mm), high-level float that cuts pump power through a relay (no firmware in that path),\nbrushed pump on a MOSFET (pump B) or a TMC2209 stepstick (pump A).  Notes: hardware/DESIGN.md, docs/schematic.md" (at 20 16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 1680a948-63e8-5945-9559-3a5c8b739a4b)
  )
  (text "OLIMEX ESP32-POE-ISO (WROOM)\nEXT1/EXT2: 1x10, 2.54 mm, 25.4 mm apart.\nCarrier: female sockets. Olimex: male headers.\nBoot straps: GPIO 0/2/5/12/15.\nGPI39/GPI35: check the Olimex sense jumpers are open." (at 20 45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid efbb7608-c2c2-5a74-8026-648e2a1ce41f)
  )
