  (text "LEVEL JACKS x6 (3.5 mm 4-pole; a 3-pole TRS plug works too: its sleeve lands on R2 + S)\nT = signal, R1 = sensor supply (SENS_V through 100R, so a plug shorting during insertion can't pull the rail down),\nR2 = GND through 0R (remove if an Apex plug uses R2), S = GND.  VERIFY the Apex pinout before plugging Apex sensors in.\nDefault: 10k pull-up to 3V3 + 1k series + 100n (floats, open-collector or 3.3 V outputs; reads low = closed).\n5 V push-pull sensor: R_PU DNP, R_SER 10k, R_DN 20k fitted -> 5 V reads 3.33 V." (at 95 40 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 322cca9c-a23b-5985-a8e6-97c3cc6f3139)
  )
