  (text "PUMP SUPPLY 12 or 24 V (to match the pump; default build 24 V)\nBarrel (PJ-102AH, 2.0 mm pin: Mean Well P1J plugs) or screw terminal, not both at once.\nFuse -> reverse-polarity Schottky -> TVS.  The supply ground is the board GND: fine on the ISO board only." (at 95 165 0)
