  (text "HIGH-LEVEL CUTOFF (hardware only). The float is closed while the water is below the high mark.\nFloat closed -> relay coil powered -> contact feeds RAIL. High water, a cut cable or a shorted cable\n(F2 trips) drops the relay, and RAIL (pump + / stepstick VM) goes dead. Firmware only reads it (U4).\nCable: 2-core shielded pair, shield to J11-3 at this end only.  12 V build: G5LE-1 DC12, R74 2.2k." (at 95 222 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a87d62b7-d165-54a9-9a01-436cd8f72dc9)
  )
