  )
  (text "PUMP A (stepper, e.g. KPHM100/400-ST): TMC2209 stepstick, standalone.\nVM = RAIL, so the high float also cuts the driver. VIO = 3V3.\nEN (IO16) active low; R79 10k pull-up keeps it disabled at boot\nand when the ESP32 is dead. MS1/MS2 jumpers to 3V3 (open = 1/8).\nJP4: bridge only for A4988/DRV8825 (RST-SLP). J15 mates the Kamoer\nXHP-4 lead: 1 RED, 2 YEL (coil B), 3 BRN, 4 ORG (coil A).\nDon't plug or unplug the motor with RAIL live." (at 312 40 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 869c13f8-d0b9-5b2c-8e3a-e5ef37dda3fd)
  )
